<title>FRANCE: New French government to meet on Thursday.</title>
<headline>New French government to meet on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's new government led by Socialist Prime Minister Lionel Jospin will hold its first cabinet meeting on Thursday morning, an aide to President Jacques Chirac announced.</p>
<p>Dominique de Villepin, secretary-general at the French presidency, said in a statement that Chirac would chair the meeting starting at 10 a.m. (0800 GMT).</p>
